\eqn{MS_{error}=\sum (n_j-1)s_j^2/(N-k)}:
\deqn{t_{ij}=\frac{|\bar{y}_i-\bar{y}_j|}{\sqrt{MS_{error}(1/n_i+1/n_j)}},\qquad df=N-k}

Games-Howell (Games & Howell, 1976) uses the two group variances and the
